# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# UrbanSafai — Environment Variables
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Copy this file as .env and fill in the values.
# On Hostinger / Supabase: set these in the Environment Variables panel.
#
# FIRST-TIME DEPLOYMENT STEPS:
# 1. Create a Supabase project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Get your connection info from: Database page > click "Connect" button > URI tab
#    OR: Settings (gear) > Database > Connection info
# 3. IMPORTANT: Free tier direct connection is IPv6 only.
#    Use the Supavisor Pooler (IPv4) for Hostinger:
#    - DATABASE_URL: use "Session mode" pooler (port 5432)
#    - DIRECT_URL:  use "Transaction mode" pooler (port 6543)
#    Format: postgresql://postgres.[ref]:[password]@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:[port]/postgres
# 4. Set all variables below in Hostinger
# 5. Deploy / restart the app
# 6. Run `npx prisma db push` OR visit /api/setup to create tables
# 7. Visit https://urbansafai.in/api/health  (verify everything is set)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─── Database (Supabase / PostgreSQL) ─────────────────────────────────
# IMPORTANT: Free tier = IPv6 only for direct connection.
# Hostinger is IPv4 — MUST use the Pooler endpoint (aws-0-[region].pooler.supabase.com)
#
# DATABASE_URL: Pooler Session mode (port 5432) — for app queries
# DIRECT_URL:  Pooler Transaction mode (port 6543) — for prisma db push / migrations
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.[ref]:[password]@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:5432/postgres"
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://postgres.[ref]:[password]@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres"

# ─── NextAuth (Admin Login) ────────────────────────────────────────────
NEXTAUTH_SECRET=0FDZf1PkSGP0LYznANgnJO8+NXtSVuMBHa8PRJ2bp7s=
NEXTAUTH_URL=https://urbansafai.in

# ─── Admin Credentials ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@urbansafai.in
ADMIN_PASSWORD=UrbanSafai@2025

# ─── Email (Resend) ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Get your key at https://resend.com/api-keys
# Sends booking notification to admin + confirmation to customer
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your-resend-api-key-here

# ─── Server (optional, defaults shown) ─────────────────────────────────
# PORT=3000
# HOSTNAME=0.0.0.0
